  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/gloom-sh/gloomberb/zipball/v0.16.3",
  "body": "## Highlights\n\n- **Smoother pane drags.** Panes follow the pointer without redrawing the layout, and a quick click no longer leaves the window following the pointer. (#1493, #1499, #1500)\n- **Broker portfolios show their equity.** `PF` leads with `Net Liq`, labels the positions' sum `Gross`, and adds `Cash` and `Lev`. The account is kept across restarts, a lapsed broker sign-in is named in the footer, and `KELLY` sizes from equity. (#1504)\n- **`MAP` as a world map.** Country names on the map, and a flight opens where flights show. (#1495, #1498, #1492)\n- **Holder values in the right currency.** `HDS` labels each holder value in its own currency and marks depositary-receipt share counts. (#1496)\n- **Members in other panes.** Open a theme's or fund's members in `RRG`, `CORR`, `SIW` or `RIPL`, or save them as a watchlist. (#1465)\n\n## Also in this release\n\n- Arrow keys scroll detail panes that left scrolling unset. (#1502)\n- `fn` and `fundamentals --csv` write flat rows with the displayed columns. (#1494)\n- The CLI rejects unknown options, and `history` says why bars are missing. (#1497)\n- US quotes stay available after the close until an after-hours trade prints. (#1501)\n- A zero enterprise value shows as missing, and trailing figures name the reporting currency. (#1489)\n- Thinly traded listings use Gloom Cloud's not-stale verdict. (#1490)\n\n[Full diff](https://github.com/gloom-sh/gloomberb/compare/v0.16.2...v0.16.3)\n"
}
